# Chipper
// There and back: in order, then back without repeating the last line (SPEC §5)
For time, cap 25:00, teams of 2, there and back
  50 cal Row (split)
  40 Pull-up (split)
  10 Wall walk (split)

# Out and back AMRAP
AMRAP 12, aller-retour
  5 Burpee
  10 Air squat
  15 Sit-up

# Two parts
3 rounds for time, there and back
  10 Push-up
  10 Sit-up
AMRAP 5
  10 Burpee
